+---
+id: task-003-fix-cancellation-coupon-reuse-and-free-shipping-threshold
+type: task
+title: "Fix cancellation coupon reuse and free shipping threshold"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Correct the order-service handling reported by customers and support:
+
+- A cancelled confirmed order must release the single-use coupon redeemed by that order, so the
+  customer can apply it to a corrected order.
+- Delivery must be free when discounted goods are exactly €50.00 (5,000 cents), as well as above
+  that threshold.
+
+Cover both boundaries with deterministic automated tests. Keep the existing public API and pricing
+rules intact.
